[{"category":"section","location":"#JackBaboon","page":"JackBaboon","text":"Julia executor with limited concurrency.","title":"JackBaboon"},{"category":"section","location":"#API","page":"JackBaboon","text":"","title":"API"},{"category":"type","location":"#JackBaboon.Executor","page":"JackBaboon","text":"Executor(;\n    pool         :: Symbol  = :default,\n    capacity     :: Integer = 8,\n    concurrently :: Integer = 1,\n)\n\nCreate and run executor with limited concurrency.\n\nArguments\n\npool: thread pool; supported: :default, :interactive.\ncapacity: maximum number of queued jobs; new jobs are rejected when queue is full.\nconcurrently: maximum number of jobs executing concurrently.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.Executor"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.execute!","page":"JackBaboon","text":"execute!(@nospecialize(f), executor::Executor)\n\nSynchronous concurrently execution.\n\nExamples\n\njulia> result = execute!(executor) do cancel_token\n           do_work()\n       end;\n\njulia> result = execute!(executor) do cancel_token\n           error(\"Job error\")\n       end;\nERROR: Job error\nStacktrace:\n [1] error()\n ...\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.execute!"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.submit!","page":"JackBaboon","text":"submit!(@nospecialize(f), executor::Executor)::Handle\n\nAsynchronous concurrently execution.\n\nExamples\n\njulia> handle = submit!(executor) do cancel_token\n           do_work()\n       end;\njulia> result = fetch(handle);\njulia> handle = submit!(executor) do cancel_token\n           error(\"Job error\")\n       end;\njulia> fetch(handle)\nERROR: Job error\nStacktrace:\n [1] error(s::String)\n ...\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.submit!"},{"category":"method","location":"#Base.isopen-Tuple{Executor}","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isopen(executor::Executor)::Bool\n\nReturns true if executor is ready to accept jobs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Base.isopen"},{"category":"method","location":"#Base.close-Tuple{Executor}","page":"JackBaboon","text":"close(executor::Executor)::Executor\n\nGraceful shutdown; immediately stop accepting new jobs; accepted jobs are finalize.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Base.close"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isclosed","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isclosed(executor::Executor)::Bool\n\nReturns true if executor is closed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isclosed"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.iscrashed","page":"JackBaboon","text":"iscrashed(executor::Executor)::Bool\n\nReturns true if executor is crashed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.iscrashed"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.iscancelrequested","page":"JackBaboon","text":"iscancelrequested(token::CancelToken)::Bool\n\nReturn true if stop has been requested for the job.\n\nExamples\n\njulia> executor = Executor();\n\njulia> handle = submit!(executor) do cancel_token\n        while ! iscancelrequested(cancel_token)\n            do_work()\n            yield()\n        end\n        nothing\n    end;\n\njulia> stop!(handle);\n\njulia> wait(handle)\n\njulia> iscanceled(handle)\ntrue\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.iscancelrequested"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isqueued","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isqueued(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job in executor queue.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isqueued"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.ispending","page":"JackBaboon","text":"ispending(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job is pending execution.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.ispending"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.iscanceled","page":"JackBaboon","text":"iscanceled(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job was canceled and task is completed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.iscanceled"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isrunning","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isrunning(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job task is executing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isrunning"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.iscompleted","page":"JackBaboon","text":"iscompleted(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job task completed successfully.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.iscompleted"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.stop!","page":"JackBaboon","text":"stop!(handle::Handle)::Handle\n\nJob stopping; job completion is a user responsibility.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.stop!"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isstopping","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isstopping(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if running job stopping in progress.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isstopping"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isstopped","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isstopped(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job is stopped.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isstopped"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isfailed","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isfailed(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job task is failed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isfailed"},{"category":"function","location":"#JackBaboon.isfinal","page":"JackBaboon","text":"isfinal(handle::Handle)::Bool\n\nReturns true if job in final state.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.isfinal"},{"category":"method","location":"#Base.wait-Tuple{JackBaboon.Handle}","page":"JackBaboon","text":"wait(handle::Handle; throw=true)::Nothing\n\nWait job finalize.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Base.wait"},{"category":"method","location":"#Base.fetch-Tuple{JackBaboon.Handle}","page":"JackBaboon","text":"fetch(handle::Handle)::Any\n\nWait job finalize and fetch result or throw error.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Base.fetch"},{"category":"type","location":"#JackBaboon.ExecutorClosedError","page":"JackBaboon","text":"ExecutorClosedError(msg::AbstractString)\n\nThrown on a job submitting to a closed executor.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.ExecutorClosedError"},{"category":"type","location":"#JackBaboon.ExecutorRejectedError","page":"JackBaboon","text":"ExecutorRejectedError(msg::AbstractString)\n\nThrown on a job submitting to an executor with a full queue.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.ExecutorRejectedError"},{"category":"type","location":"#JackBaboon.JobCancelledError","page":"JackBaboon","text":"JobCancelledError(msg::AbstractString)\n\nThrown on fetch result from cancelling or cancelled job.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.JobCancelledError"},{"category":"type","location":"#JackBaboon.ExecutorInternalError","page":"JackBaboon","text":"ExecutorInternalError(msg::AbstractString)\n\nThrown on an internal executor error.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JackBaboon.ExecutorInternalError"}]
